# Edge-case testing

- After any major feature or integration, test edge cases before moving on.
- Cover at least: empty input, invalid input, missing env/keys, network/API failure, slow response, and mid-flow pause/skip where relevant.
- Use subagents for broader regression or multi-path checks when needed.
- Fix broken edge cases before declaring the work done.
